From c0221c728c947c5b87385741553f9e7b8a7ac2fe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Mohamed R. Khalil" <m.radwan.khalil@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 05:44:58 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix(v2): forward prompt file parts to the V2 session as files

The V2 host adapter kept only text parts when translating a V1
session.prompt into the V2 prompt call, so every attachment built by
look_at (file: and data: URLs) was dropped before it reached OpenCode.
multimodal-looker children were stored as text-only user messages and
answered "No attachment is visible".

Map V1 `{ type: "file", url, filename }` parts (and V2-shaped body.files)
to `files: [{ uri, name }]` in sendPrompt and in the CLI run client and its
HTTP transport. Text-only prompts send no files key. noReply prompts stay
synthetic and log that their attachments cannot be delivered.

(cherry picked from commit 697555e5dc9156516ac279a5b1556098b962b94a)
